Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:04.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's morning, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:10.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Breakfast is ready, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:12.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:15.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:17.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry about this every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:19.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How about you? Is your body all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:26.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's starting to get better,\Nbut it still screams everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't overwork yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:29.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:41.90,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.11,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,So you're here. Hurry and get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:45.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:48.24,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs63\frz341.343\pos(1273.5,1021.5)\c&H444345&}Okazaki
