Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.84,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You're not holding the spanner right. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:02.59,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I showed you how it's done many times. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:03.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.22,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You're using too much adhesive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.55,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,And screw them in diagonal order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:09.22,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! {ep 10}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:13.68,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Concentrate. You'll get hurt if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:14.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:20.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:22.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:25.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I bought pork so you'll get your energy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'll be ready soon, so please sit and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:33.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The bath is ready, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:36.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.46,Default,TV,0,0,0,,I said that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:41.34,Default,TV,0,0,0,,No~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:43.17,Default,TV,0,0,0,,If you want it, go buy your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:44.34,Default,TV,0,0,0,,All right~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:46.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Are you sleepy, Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:49.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:56.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm being supported by Nagisa right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:02:01.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa worries and comes to see me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:05.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's all it takes me to keep\Nworking hard without giving up.
